  "limitations": [
    "Exact author scope is miner22, monitor16 and protocol4 normal/race with three-package vet. Prior callback/startup/component counts are separate; no full miner/mainnet/server qualification.",
    "Production adapters call actual SDK identity/carrier/key/readiness getters; tests use owned synthetic transports/device interfaces and real public HTTP/monitor lifetimes. No live provider/device observation is claimed.",
    "Independent reviewed roster/source, freshness, process generation, sequence, member generation and retained checkpoint are required; process status alone cannot establish readiness. Proof and settlement stay explicitly unknown until qualified real producer hooks exist.",
    "Original c3 route baseline and current-source old-method overlays both refuse the intended assertions; normal/race overlay failures are inspected for exact legacy200 and missing404 causes.",
    "Intermediate c525 capacity controls are retained separately. The maximum-roster negative currently detects absent output via its watchdog; a separate deterministic worker-exit test successor is being prepared, so that timeout is not counted as a causal proof here.",
    "Current provider source remains on its frozen0a5/server10a module graph. The published e0d/current-server successor is separately qualified and is not inherited by this receipt.",
    "Independent provider qualification, full MG07 proof/settlement monitoring, finite claim retry, fleet semantic runtime selection, new release composition and deployment remain open."
  ],
